<title>USA: Anicom Inc completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Anicom Inc completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anicom Inc said Tuesday it completed the sale and issuance of 1.21 million shares of common stock in a private placement that raised about $15.8 million before expenses.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use proceeds from the sale for acquisitions and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Anicom sells and distributes multimedia wiring products.</p>
